# Build context: tinyshop/services/frontend/ (this image only).
# Everything listed is never sent to the Docker engine, so it can't end up in an image
# or invalidate a cached layer.

# --- Installed and built inside the image -------------------------------------------------
# A host node_modules would overwrite the one npm ci just installed, and its native
# packages (Rolldown, oxlint) are built for the host's OS, not Alpine Linux.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

# --- Secrets and local configuration --------------------------------------------------
# Vite reads .env files at build time and writes every VITE_* value into the JavaScript
# that any browser downloads. Nothing from the host may reach the build.
.env
.env.*

# --- Not needed to build -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Changing these would otherwise invalidate the COPY . . layer for nothing.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
*.log
